<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OMI started on recommended list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OMI started on recommended list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of OMI Corp on the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- OMM Corp gained 5/8 to 9-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
